files.judges/mini_judge.md:
# Mini Judge — UI Interface Architect LF

## PASS checks
- governing source explicit/current;
- each material UI decision evidence-linked;
- product behavior preserved;
- required UI dimensions developed for implementation;
- applicable LF safety controls pass;
- `user_payload` contains no internal gate/source/log/score metadata;
- Quality Pack handoff complete.

## Blocking codes
- `SOURCE_AUTHORITY_MISSING`
- `PRODUCT_RULE_INVENTED`
- `INTERFACE_DECISION_INCOMPLETE`
- `LF_SAFETY_HARD_FAIL`
- `INTERNAL_METADATA_LEAKAGE`
- `OFF_SCOPE_UI_DRIFT`
- `HANDOFF_CONTEXT_INCOMPLETE`

Hard blocking code prevents `INTERFACE_DECISION_READY`.

